        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Secretive meetings undermine accountability and reduce trust in institutional outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Public hearings are intended to be inclusive forums where diverse perspectives contribute to policymaking.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
