    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80224.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "I believe that they want to pass their agenda, and they want to do it with as little compromise as possible.",
