        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Passing an agenda requires some level of political negotiation or concession.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Minimal compromise is a strategic goal in legislative processes.",
        "confidence": 0.87
