        "text": "Major reforms of the Medicare program should be undertaken in a cooperative, bipartisan manner.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The process of Medicare Reform should represent all the people of the United States.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
