        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "All U.S. citizens have equal moral standing in decisions affecting national healthcare systems.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "A representative process enhances public trust in government institutions.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
