        "text": "The speaker believes that intelligent individuals should act rationally and coherently.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Leadership actions should align with stated missions and agendas.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a discrepancy between current behavior and expected rational action based on intelligence and purpose.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker expects logical consistency between intentions and methods used by leaders.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Intelligent individuals acting with a mission would choose optimal strategies.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 80224,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80224.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "Well, you asked me for an example, and the Medicare would be the one. Their agenda is to take Medicare and make it a private insurance program. They're pushing to do that. They want to move it away from a government program. and make it a private sector program. That's the agenda. That's what they're trying to do. And that's in large part, I suspect why they are holding these closed-door meetings.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
