        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "It is meaningful to ask someone about their personal feelings on political matters.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Government-provided healthcare is a legitimate topic of public discussion.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The listener has a discernible opinion on this issue.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "Emotional responses are relevant to evaluating policy proposals.",
