    "turn_text": "Well, I think you're rolling issues together. The fact that a matter is the $87 billion that you're suggesting could have been spent for healthcare isn't available for healthcare any more than it's available for Iraq. The truth of the matter is the dirty little secret these folks who are spending that money are spending money that we don't have. That's deficit spending.",
